OL,3,GNEWSAToby Jones stars in film about UK
OL,4,AMars mission
OL,5,
OL,6,FBafta-winning actors Toby Jones and
OL,7,FEmily Watson have finished work on a
OL,8,Ffilm about the scientist behind
OL,9,FBritain's first spacecraft to land on
OL,10,FMars, which got "lost".
OL,12,FMars Express, directed by Mackenzie
OL,13,FCrook, will see Jones play Colin
OL,14,FPillinger while Watson is his wife
OL,15,FJudith.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
